{
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "revisionId": "ai100-first10-storyline-zh-huopo-interactive-v5-2026-08-07",
    "scopeId": "bench-council-ai100",
    "sequenceIndex": 2,
    "eventId": "1971-complexity-theory",
    "locale": "zh",
    "mode": "storyline",
    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "为什么旅行路线、排班和逻辑谜题看起来毫不相干，却可能撞上同一堵计算高墙？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-interaction"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "因为它们背后可能共享同一种计算困难。斯蒂芬·库克在 1971 年证明，NP 中的每个问题都可以在多项式时间内归约到布尔可满足性问题。列昂尼德·列文也独立提出了相关结果，NP 完全性由此把许多困难问题组织进同一个可比较的框架。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-the-complexity-of-theorem-proving-procedures"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-ai100-achievement", "claim-method-artifact"],
            "contentOrigin": "sourced-interactive-rewrite"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "你说“归约”，是不是可以理解为，把一个排班问题翻译成另一个逻辑问题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-interaction"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "可以这样理解，而且翻译过程本身不能花掉过多时间。归约让研究者比较不同问题的难度；如果布尔可满足性问题有多项式时间算法，那么 NP 中其他问题也能通过这种转换获得多项式时间算法。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-the-complexity-of-theorem-proving-procedures"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-ai100-achievement", "claim-method-artifact"],
            "contentOrigin": "sourced-interactive-rewrite"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "等等，既然叫 NP 完全，是不是意味着这些问题已经被证明绝对无解？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-interaction"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "不是，这是最常见的误解。NP 完全不等于无解，也没有证明 P 不等于 NP；它说明我们目前不知道适用于这类问题的通用多项式时间算法。具体实例仍可能借助特殊结构、启发式方法、近似算法或指数搜索求解。",
            "sourceIds": [
                "source-clay-mathematics-institute-p-vs-np",
                "source-the-complexity-of-theorem-proving-procedures"
            ],
            "claimIds": ["claim-ai100-achievement", "claim-method-artifact"],
            "contentOrigin": "sourced-interactive-rewrite"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "所以对 AI 工程师来说，它不是一句“放弃吧”，而是先提醒你选对求解策略？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-interaction"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "正是如此。规划、调度、组合搜索和约束求解经常遇到这类复杂度障碍。先判断问题有多难，才能决定应该精确搜索、利用启发式，还是接受近似答案；那堵计算高墙没有消失，但我们至少学会了先辨认它。",
            "sourceIds": [
                "source-stephen-a-cook-acm-a-m-turing-award",
                "source-clay-mathematics-institute-p-vs-np",
                "source-the-complexity-of-theorem-proving-procedures"
            ],
            "claimIds": ["claim-ai100-achievement", "claim-method-artifact"],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-interactive-closing"
        }
    ]
}
